Rivaroxaban tablets in measured doses for retail sale are medicaments of heading 3004. Rivaroxaban is a heterocyclic compound with an oxazolidinone ring, a thiophene ring, and a morpholinone ring. Heading 3004.90 is the "other" medicaments group, and the statistical suffix is 9230 or similar. HTS 3004.90.92 is "Other" under the 3004.90.9 group, with 3004.90.9290 or 3004.90.9255 as possible suffixes. I recall that 3004.90.92 breaks down into statistical suffixes including 3004.90.9210 and 3004.90.9230 for specific categories. Since the 3004.90.92 suffix list is uncertain, I am going with 3004.90.9290.

Rivaroxaban is commonly listed under 3004.90.9290 in the "Other" medicaments category, though I have not verified the suffix.

{"hts_code": "3004.90.9290", "reason": "Rivaroxaban tablets in measured doses for retail sale are medicaments of heading 3004 and fall under the residual 'other' subheading 3004.90.92."}
